{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:50 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:50 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:50 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"21 BORRETT ROAD四房1.61億招標沽 每呎7.46萬\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8661b95b6866237cb1d3f1cee667468/2026-10/20250731_FIN_21_BORRETT_ROAD.png\"/><p>長實旗下中半山超級豪宅21 BORRETT ROAD，以招標形式售出16樓05號單位，面積2,166平方呎，四房雙套連儲物房間隔，連2個車位，成交價逾1.61億元，呎價約74,600元。</p><p>長實營業經理陳詠慈表示，該項目向來深受具實力買家的追捧。上述成交反映出高淨值人士對優質物業強烈需求，預期同類頂級物業未來將繼續受到成為市場焦點。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:31.297655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:50:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:50.335239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:11.527906+00:00","content_hash":"04f494f348e7083f52a693437d1890a15a05ee1e83e610bf52071ade1dc2973d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}